  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the onion and haloumi. Pick the coriander leaves and finely chop the stems. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539672/photos/large/80117_1-5c8ec4969fda2b4fbc072c0b07e20293.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soften onion: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the onion and coriander stems, stirring, for 4 mins or until softened. Add the garlic and curry powder and cook, stirring, for 30 secs or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539673/photos/large/80117_2-5b7f8b26525dff43136e92332f1b3365.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wilt spinach: Add the spinach and 2 tsp water to the pan and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until wilted. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539674/photos/large/80117_3-3980e6739256e2a3b96b7b89b9eb023e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread with the tomato paste and top with the spinach mixture and haloumi. Bake the pizzas for 12 mins or until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539675/photos/large/80117_4-812b3c3c9094c189b559f39480afc831.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Scatter the coriander leaves over the pizzas, cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539676/photos/large/80117_5-50761ef931575241ebe1c0e2fec0ef25.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you know?: A type of curry powder, vadouvan (pronounced vah-doo-vahn) originated in the French colonised area of Pondicherry in southeast India. It's milder and slightly sweeter than most Indian curry powders.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2539677/photos/large/80117_6-1eb8a6733580325eb5c2f460a366a9b1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
